                    \.
          %p
            With the advent of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Topos+Theory"} Higher Topos Theory
            abstract concepts of
            %em space and quantity
            have been realized fully in the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} (∞,1)-toposes
            in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structured+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} structured (∞,1)-toposes
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+scheme"} generalized schemes
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+the+derived+moduli+stack+of+derived+elliptic+curves#NotionsOfSpace"} notions of space
